pean data protection law, our role depends on the type of data we process:<=
/p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Company as a Data Controller:</strong> We act as a Controller f=
or personal data related to account management, billing, marketing, and usa=
ge analytics of our website and platform.</li>
<li><strong>Company as a Data Processor:</strong> When you upload data into=
 the Service to be processed by our AI models (=E2=80=9CCustomer Data=E2=80=
=9D or =E2=80=9CInput=E2=80=9D), you act as the Controller, and we act as t=
he Processor. In these cases, the processing is strictly governed by our Da=
ta Processing Addendum (DPA).</li>
</ul></section>
<section class=3D"clause"><h3 id=3D"part-1-section-2" tabindex=3D"-1"><span=
>02</span>Categories of Data We Collect</h3><p>We collect and process the f=
ollowing categories of personal data:</p>
