device identifiers, time-zone settings, and logs of your interactions with =
our platform or APIs.</li>
<li><strong>AI Input &amp; Prompt Data:</strong> Any personal data that you=
 voluntarily include within the prompts, text, files, or media you submit t=
o our AI engines (=E2=80=9CInput=E2=80=9D).</li>
</ul></section>
<section class=3D"clause"><h3 id=3D"part-1-section-3" tabindex=3D"-1"><span=
>03</span>Legal Bases for Processing</h3><p>In accordance with Article 6 of=
 the GDPR, we rely on the following legal bases to process your data:</p>
<ul>
