vide access to the AI Service, process payments, and provide customer suppo=
rt.</li>
<li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> To secure our platform, detect f=
raudulent usage, and optimize the technical performance of our infrastructu=
re.</li>
<li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> To comply with fiscal, accounting, a=
nd regulatory obligations under Belgian law.</li>
<li><strong>Consent:</strong> Where you have explicitly opted-in to receive=
 marketing communications or accepted non-essential cookies.</li>
</ul></section>
<section class=3D"clause"><h3 id=3D"part-1-section-4" tabindex=3D"-1"><span=
>04</span>AI Processing, Hybrid Infrastructure, and Model Training</h3><p>O=
perating an AI platform in 2026 requires strict adherence to AI-specific pr=
ivacy principles. Our platform utilizes a hybrid AI infrastructure:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Sovereign European Hosting:</strong> Our platform, database, an=
d open-source AI models are physically hosted in Belgium at Combell, a loca=
l Belgian data center, ensuring high-level local data sovereignty and secur=
ity.</li>
<li><strong>Third-Party AI Infrastructure:</strong> To provide advanced cap=
abilities, specific functionalities are routed via API to vetted third-part=
y AI infrastructure providers, including OpenAI and Anthropic. All data sen=
t through these APIs is processed strictly under data protection agreements=
 that prohibit those third parties from using your data to train their mode=
ls.</li>
