<section class=3D"clause"><h3 id=3D"part-1-section-6" tabindex=3D"-1"><span=
>06</span>Data Transfers Outside the EEA</h3><p>While your primary account =
and metadata are securely hosted locally with Combell in Belgium, using thi=
rd-party APIs (OpenAI / Anthropic) may involve data transit. Where data is =
transferred outside the European Economic Area (EEA), we ensure a valid tra=
nsfer mechanism is in place, such as an EU Adequacy Decision or the executi=
